# PostHog project API key (Project settings -> Project API key). Safe to expose:
# it is write-only and cannot read data back out.
#
# There is deliberately no host variable. Ingestion goes through the `/relay`
# proxy declared in `next.config.ts`, and the real PostHog origin is set there.
#
# Unset means analytics is a no-op — `instrumentation-client.ts` skips init
# entirely — so the site runs fine without it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
